That's a bug in Vanilla.
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Shk.c#line1653

This line reads
if (cansee(shkp->mx, shkp->my && croaked))
but should read
if (cansee(shkp->mx, shkp->my) && croaked)

So the location of the deceased player isn't correctly checked
for visibility and that's why you get the message even though no
shopkeeper is near.

